<div id="p1" class="ltx_para"><img src="2605.06869v1/figures/banner_new.png" id="g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:310/88;" width="310" height="88" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</div>
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Agentick: A Unified Benchmark for General Sequential Decision-Making Agents</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Roger Creus Castanyer <span id="id1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.5pt;"><img src="2605.06869v1/figures/logo_mila.jpg" id="g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:14/14;" width="14" height="14" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span> <span id="id2" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.5pt;"><img src="2605.06869v1/figures/logo_udem.jpg" id="g3" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:14/14;" width="14" height="14" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span>
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
