<span class="ltx_personname">Pablo Samuel Castro<sup id="id3" class="ltx_sup">∗</sup> <span id="id4" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.5pt;"><img src="2605.06869v1/figures/logo_mila.jpg" id="g4" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:14/14;" width="14" height="14" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span> <span id="id5" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.5pt;"><img src="2605.06869v1/figures/logo_udem.jpg" id="g5" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:14/14;" width="14" height="14" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span> <span id="id6" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.5pt;"><img src="2605.06869v1/figures/logo_deepmind.png" id="g6" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:14/14;" width="14" height="14" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span>
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Mila Quebec AI Institute
