<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A6.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix F Per-Category ONS Results ‣ Agentick: A Unified Benchmark for General Sequential Decision-Making Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> reports per-category ONS for all evaluated agents.</p>
